      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100442683820990464
    m_Localized: "Enemy: Lil Godwilla\n Type: Ghost\n \n Lil Godwilla moves slowly, but in chase state she is much more faster - it is better to keep distance to avoid being chased.\n \n - Godwilla can appear in rooms.\n - Don't go into the direction of whispers.\n \n Objective: You begin in one of three hospital garages. The goal is to repair the car to escape. You need to find the following parts to escape: 4 wheels, a battery, a fuel and keys."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100442893364224000
    m_Localized: '- The following color during gameplay means that you can use perk by pressing it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100442948401881088
    m_Localized: '- Perk might become unavailable in one of the following situations 1.Perk has been used. 2.You have insufficient amount of perks. 3.Perk is not supported in the current map'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100442990726602752
    m_Localized: '- The following color during gameplay means that the perk activates automatically during gameplay (AKA situational perks)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100443264916643840
    m_Localized: Play ranked matches and increase your league, climb up the leaderboard to earn unique rewards, unlock new perks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100442806256918528
    m_Localized: "Enemy: Crawler\n Type: Monster\n \n Crawler can climb on walls. He can't see you if your flashlight is turned off. Avoid being near a well-lit areas.\n \n Objective: turn on 9 generators to power the main gate while solving a series of puzzles to get to the end."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100442765878353920
    m_Localized: "Enemy: Statue\n Type: Ghost\n \n Statue's weak points are doors and flashlight. It can't move when you're pointing your flashlight in it's direction, but keep in mind that the flashlight does not last indefinitely. Close doors behind you - it will slow down the Statue.\n \n Objective: escape through the main gate by solving puzzles. Open the security room, fix the fuse box, solve the gate puzzle"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100651811931676672
    m_Localized: Would you like to read a manual on the game?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100443079041867776
    m_Localized: You can choose to play against enemy player. One of the player will be chosen as an enemy. Enemy has to eliminate every survivor to win.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100443123220471808
    m_Localized: '-'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
