  - m_Id: 142834375297675264
    m_Localized: "Enemy: Multiple\n Type: Monster/Ghost\n \n You're trapped in a cursed apartment, find anomalies to progress to the next floor and escape by reaching the 1st floor.\n There are multiple enemies. Every enemy has their own unique behaviour, you'll have to find a way to counter them.\n \n Objective: Reach floor 1 and escape apartments by finding anomalies"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 142945805277323264
    m_Localized: Ambience Volume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 225181801500717056
    m_Localized: To receive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 237495895343837184
    m_Localized: Dynamic FOV (Useful for ipads)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276883785015877632
    m_Localized: "EMF reader detects ghost presence and recent ghost activity.\n \n Use EMF reader to quickly find approximate ghost area/room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276884345370697728
    m_Localized: "Use your UV flashlight\n to detect Ultraviolet evidence.\n \n Ghost can leave handprints after interacting with doors or light switches."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276884748233596928
    m_Localized: "Get the reponse from spirit box inside ghost's area as an evidence.\n \n You have a higher chance to get the response during ghost activity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 276885054124187648
    m_Localized: "Use thermometer to finalize ghost's area/room, below 5°C.\n \n Freezing temperature evidence is below 0°C."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 282648870095151104
    m_Localized: There is a chance the candle will be blown out when placed inside the ghost room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 282650206387822592
    m_Localized: Ghost orbs will appear near the ghost when there's ghost activity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 283047612266831872
    m_Localized: "Enemy: Slaughter Ghost\n Type: Ghost\n \n You were kidnapped and brought to a secret underground facility. They promise freedom if you succeed in finding the correct ghost evidence.\n The ghost absorbs electrical current when manifesting, causing lights to flicker.\n \n Ghost resides in one of the rooms, and will begin its hunt from there when provoked.\n You can avoid ghost's line of sight by hiding behind obstructions.\n \n Objective: Find correct ghost evidences to complete the ritual and escape."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 283166627928727552
    m_Localized: Can be unlocked during events
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
