  - m_Id: 333436520313909248
    m_Localized: Halloween offer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334158882109911040
    m_Localized: '<b>Halloween update!</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159067712057344
    m_Localized: This update brings Halloween sceneries, halloween side quests, new personal quests items, balance changes and long awaited improvements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159223740166144
    m_Localized: '<b>Wildcard</b> - Replaces a random perk at start. After death, all your perks can be used again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159342065676288
    m_Localized: '<b>Sewers Remake is coming!</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159425653960704
    m_Localized: In the near future we will release Sewers Remake. During the release, there will be a dedicated event with exclusive rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159535779606528
    m_Localized: '<b>Halloween Exclusive Perk</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159602901053440
    m_Localized: "There is now personal quest items that you can get. They allow you to start any personal quest at any time you want - and receive nice reward for completing them! There are two types of quests: Standard and Halloween.\n \n <b>Personal Quest Items:</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159755850543104
    m_Localized: '<b>New items: Shards</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159819700432896
    m_Localized: '<b>New Skins:</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159913132748800
    m_Localized: '<b>Improvements & Balance Changes</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334159970821206016
    m_Localized: '<b>New Hat & Trophy:</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334160049946750976
    m_Localized: '<b>Crowbar</b> - Allows you to pry open any locked door.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
